</td></tr><tr style=";height:43px"><td width="101" style="border-right: 1px solid windowtext; border-bottom: 1px solid windowtext; border-left: 1px solid windowtext; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0px 7px;"><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体">实践小队</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体">个人分工</span></strong></p></td><td width="189" colspan="3" style="border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1px solid windowtext; border-right: 1px solid windowtext; padding: 0px 7px;">
</td><td width="104" colspan="2" style="border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1px solid windowtext; border-right: 1px solid windowtext; padding: 0px 7px;"><p style="text-align:center;line-height:24px"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体">实践单位</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体">服务对象</span></strong></p></td><td width="186" colspan="2" style="border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1px solid windowtext; border-right: 1px solid windowtext; padding: 0px 7px;">
</td></tr><tr style=";height:47px"><td width="101" style="border-right: 1px solid windowtext; border-bottom: 1px solid windowtext; border-left: 1px solid windowtext; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0px 7px;"><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体">活动时间</span></strong></p></td><td width="479" colspan="7" style="border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1px solid windowtext; border-right: 1px solid windowtext; padding: 0px 7px;"><p><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体">从</span></strong><strong><span style="text-decoration:underline;">      </span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体">年</span></strong><strong><span style="text-decoration:underline;">    </span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体">月</span></strong><strong><span style="text-decoration:underline;">    </span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体">日</span></strong><strong><span style="text-decoration:underline;">    </span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体">时至</span></strong><strong><span style="text-decoration:underline;">    </span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体">月</span></strong><strong><span style="text-decoration:underline;">    </span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体">日</span></strong><strong><span style="text-decoration:underline;">    </span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体">时，合计</span></strong><strong><span style="text-decoration:underline;">      </span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体">小时</span></strong><strong>
   </strong><span style=";font-family:宋体">（</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:black">小时与学分折算：</span><span style=";font-family:'ˎ̥','serif';color:black">3</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:black">学时≈</span><span style=";font-family:'ˎ̥','serif';color:black">1/4</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:black">学分，</span><span style=";font-family:'ˎ̥','serif';color:black">6</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:black">学时≈</span><span style=";font-family:'ˎ̥','serif';color:black">1/2</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:black">学分，</span><span style=";font-family:'ˎ̥','serif';color:black">12</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:black">学时≈</span><span style=";font-family:'ˎ̥','serif';color:black">1</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;color:black">学分</span><span style=";font-family:宋体">）</span></p></td></tr><tr style=";height:173px"><td width="101" style="border-right: 1px solid windowtext; border-bottom: 1px solid windowtext; border-left: 1px solid windowtext; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0px 7px;"><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体">活动要求</span></strong></p></td><td width="479" colspan="7" style="border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1px solid windowtext; border-right: 1px solid windowtext; padding: 0px 7px;"><p style="margin-left:24px">1）<span style="font:9px 'Times New Roman'">  </span><span style=";font-family:宋体">事前要充分准备，计划好各个事项，确保活动安全与效果；事中要人人分工，分享锻炼机会。</span></p><p style="margin-left:24px">2）<span style="font:9px 'Times New Roman'">  </span><span style=";font-family:宋体">开学第一周，班级初审（评）：学生分组班内汇报活动情况，侧重交流活动体会与启示；制作团支部或支部内小队活动的报告与</span>PPT<span style=";font-family:宋体">（电子版）。</span></p><p style="margin-left:24px">3）<span style="font:9px 'Times New Roman'">  </span><span style=";font-family:宋体">开学第二周，学校组织社会实践评奖与表彰活动。</span></p><p style="margin-left:24px">4）<span style="font:9px 'Times New Roman'">  </span><span style=";font-family:宋体">本表统一上交至德育处团委作为相应学分认定的依据。经认定后，本表格发还学生本人妥善保管，以备高三阶段高校自招等选拔的材料审核。</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体">备注：</span><span style="font-family:宋体">鼓励并提倡学生在高一、高二期间完成三学年总量</span>8<span style="font-family:   宋体">学分的社会实践类选修课程；每个暑假</span>/<span style="font-family:   宋体">寒假每人不超过</span>2<span style="font-family:   宋体">学分，每个学期（含暑假</span>/<span style="font-family:   宋体">寒假）每人不超过</span>3<span style="font-family:   宋体">学分，高中期间</span><span style="font-family:宋体;color:black">学生参加同一社会实践活动的学分最高不超过</span><span style="font-family:'ˎ̥','serif';color:black">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体;color:black">学分。</span></p></td></tr><tr style=";height:244px"><td width="101" style="border-right: 1px solid windowtext; border-bottom: 1px solid windowtext; border-left: 1px solid windowtext; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0px 7px;"><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体">活动过程</span></strong></p></td><td width="479" colspan="7" valign="top" style="border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1px solid windowtext; border-right: 1px solid windowtext; padding: 0px 7px;"><p><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体">佐证材料：简要文字说明，并配以相应的活动照片，可附页。</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style=";height:65px"><td width="101" style="border-right: 1px solid windowtext; border-bottom: 1px solid windowtext; border-left: 1px solid windowtext; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0px 7px;"><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体">活动体会</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体">与启示</span></strong></p></td><td width="479" colspan="7" valign="top" style="border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1px solid windowtext; border-right: 1px solid windowtext; padding: 0px 7px;">
