</td><td width="92" colspan="2" style="border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1px solid windowtext; border-right: 1px solid windowtext; padding: 0px 7px;"><p style="text-align:center;line-height:27px"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体">班级初审</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:27px"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体">结</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size:16px">    </span></strong><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:   宋体">果</span></strong></p></td><td width="209" colspan="3" style="border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1px solid windowtext; border-right: 1px solid windowtext; padding: 0px 7px;"><p style="text-align:left;text-indent:8px;line-height:27px"><strong><span style="font-size:16px">1</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体">）活动（真实</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size:16px">   / </span></strong><strong><span style="font-size:   16px;font-family:宋体">虚假）</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:left;text-indent:8px;line-height:27px"><strong><span style="font-size:16px">2</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体">）实际时间</span></strong><strong><span style="text-decoration:underline;"><span style="font-size:16px">      </span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:   宋体">小时</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style=";height:66px"><td width="101" style="border-right: 1px solid windowtext; border-bottom: 1px solid windowtext; border-left: 1px solid windowtext; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0px 7px;"><p style="text-align:center;line-height:27px"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体">学生诚信</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height:27px"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:宋体">签</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size:16px">    </span></strong><strong><span style="font-size:16px;font-family:   宋体">名</span></strong></p></